<title>HONG KONG: Harbour Centre interim net up 62.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Harbour Centre interim net up 62.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   59.0	vs 36.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    11.0	vs 10.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  24.2 gain vs 13.2 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    185.7     vs 114.5</p>
<p>    Turnover		     581.4     vs 679.6</p>
<p>    Company name		 Harbour Centre Development Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 1-4</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 11</p>
<p>NOTE - A hotel and property investment firm.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of hotels and investment property in the U.S.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
